{"content":"h15.\n\nMemo visibility is enforced in **thirteen** distinct places across five server surfaces (Connect/gRPC API, SSE hub, file server, RSS/sitemap HTTP routers, notification pipeline). There is no single choke point — each site re-implements the PUBLIC / PROTECTED / PRIVATE rule.\n\n**Connect/gRPC API — per-memo read guard**\n`checkMemoReadAccess` (archived → creator only; non-public → authenticated; private → creator) — server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:39-68 (callers: `GetMemo` memo_service.go:341, `ListMemoComments` memo_service_comments.go:136)\n\n**Connect/gRPC API — query-level visibility filters (list paths)**\nListMemos visibility scoping (`VisibilityList` / `creator_id == N || visibility in [...]`) — server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:218-227\nListMemoRelations relation filter — server/router/api/v1/memo_relation_service.go:107-112\nBatch relation conversion filter — server/router/api/v1/memo_service_converter.go:182-187\nListMemoComments comment filter — server/router/api/v1/memo_service_comments.go:156-160\n\n**Connect/gRPC API — write/interaction guards**\nComment creation guard (private parent → creator/admin only) — server/router/api/v1/memo_service_comments.go:33-41\nReaction guards (list + upsert) — server/router/api/v1/reaction_service.go:29-38, :82-83\nMemo-attachment access guard — server/router/api/v1/memo_attachment_service.go:213-222\nAttachment access via memo visibility — server/router/api/v1/attachment_service.go:422-455 (`checkAttachmentAccess`)\n\n**SSE delivery filter**\n`SSEClient.canReceive` (private events only to creator/admin; unknown visibility denied) — server/router/api/v1/sse_hub.go:134-144, event visibility populated at server/router/api/v1/sse_event_helpers.go:29-37\n\n**File server (non-API HTTP surface)**\n`checkAttachmentPermission` (public + AllowAnonymous, share-token fallback, private → creator/admin) — server/router/fileserver/fileserver.go:650-704\n\n**Public HTTP feeds**\nRSS feeds restricted to `store.Public` — server/router/rss/rss.go:90, :141\nSitemap restricted to `store.Public` — server/router/frontend/frontend.go:149-151\n\n**Notification pipeline**\n`canViewerAccessMemo` (admin bypass; private → creator; protected → any authenticated) — server/notification/email.go:306-320\nMention-notification eligibility checks — server/router/api/v1/memo_mention_helpers.go:62-84\n\nOne deliberate bypass worth flagging: `GetMemoByShare` resolves a memo by opaque share token **without** a visibility check — only archived/missing is rejected (server/router/api/v1/memo_share_service.go:153-192), with the matching share-token exception in the file server at fileserver.go:684-689.","iteration":11,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
